WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: The Silent Storm (1-09)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: Carnaby Street (1983)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.500
[Solitary Grand Piano & 'Safe Harbor' Flute Intro]

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:34.000
The wind has dropped beyond the trees

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:41.000
A sudden calm upon the seas

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:48.000
We watched the lightning strike the ground

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:55.000
But now there is no other sound

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:02.000
The broken glass is swept away

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:09.500
To leave us in the light of day

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:16.500
And we are walking in the silent storm...

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.200
Waiting for the water to keep us warm...

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.200
The empty space is just a shape we leave behind

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:37.800
A quiet place for us to finally find!

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.000
In the silent storm...

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:56.200
[Gentle Flute & Grand Piano Interlude]

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:02.000
You fold the papers, close the door

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:09.200
We don't need answers anymore

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:16.200
The orchestra has gone to sleep

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:23.200
And gave us promises to keep

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.500
We crossed the ocean in the dark

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:38.200
To rescue one remaining spark

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:45.000
And we are walking in the silent storm...

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:52.800
Waiting for the water to keep us warm...

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:59.700
The empty space is just a shape we leave behind

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:06.500
A quiet place for us to finally find!

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:18.000
In the silent storm!

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:28.800
The true light gleams...

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.200
It always gleams...

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.500
We wake up from the shattered dreams...

00:03:37.700 --> 00:04:38.200
[Majestic Flute, Sweeping Strings & Vocalises Crescendo]

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:43.000
The silent storm...

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:50.000
The true light gleams...

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:59.000
[Warm Synth Pad & Harp Fade to Silence]
